  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore not a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of its connections to the existing two-storey rear extension, would mean an overall two-storey enlargement that extends beyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse by more than 3 metres, and would be within 2 metres of the boundary of the curtilage of the dwellinghouse while having a height to the eaves exceeding 3 metres. Thus, the proposal is not within the tolerance of Paragraphs A.1(h)(i), A.1(j), and A.1(ja) of Part 1, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, as amended.&lt;/p&gt;"
